      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Northwind support agent\nAnswers support emails from the knowledge base and escalates the rest to a human.\n\n**Final labels:** `ai-replied`, `not-support`, `needs-human`, `ai-skipped` (plus `ai-processed` on every handled email).\n\n**Setup:** set both addresses in **Config**.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "fac6cdaa-c7fd-5f0c-b410-4ed9406e5908",
      "name": "About this workflow",
